      if (chip.dataset.mapCmdLabel !== 'static') chip.textContent = on ? 'Ausschnitte ausblenden' : 'Ausschnitte zeigen';
    }
  }
```
For the inline link, add `data-map-cmd-label="static"` in HTML. Hmm, simpler: give the inline one `data-map-cmd-label="fixed"`. Let me do that.

Also, the `for (const button of document.querySelectorAll('[data-map-cmd]'))` loop in map.js handles all of them — good.

Also note: the hint paragraph's inline button is inside `<p>` → fine (button is phrasing content).

